# Azshara (Horde) - Rares & Treasures companion (pack butler-routes-completionist, v1).
# An opportunistic sweep for the 8 flagged rares of Azshara a Horde player
# can actually engage, plus the three fixed world containers of the zone.
# Run it in its own Polestar tab at the end of the core route or standalone.
# EVERY goal is optional: a rare that is not up never holds the route.
# Spawn points and levels are the local Forever game data (questie-forever);
# the signature drop is a verified sole-drop in the item data. Respawn
# timers are unconfirmed anywhere, so none are stated. Mammoth Shark is
# NOT listed: rank 1, no rare flag, no signature loot — a quest-target
# lookalike of the broken record 91611 (see the inventory). No rare in
# this guide is a giver, ender, or objective of any Horde
# core-contracted quest. No tame lines ship (see
# docs/companion-unverified.md). See
# docs/azshara-horde-companions-inventory.md for the full inventory.
guide butler-routes-completionist/azshara-horde-rares
title Azshara (Horde) - Rares & Treasures
levels 44-50
zone Azshara
faction Horde
category Collectibles
folder Companions
keywords azshara, horde, rares, treasures, companions
coords live
version 1

step Varo'then's Ghost — the far west

  zone map 1447

  goto 13.23,74.2
  kill 6118 optional
  note Level 48 rare, flagged rare in the data, single confirmed point far west.
  note It drops Ichor of Undeath among ~120 world droppers; the shared quest The Ichor of Undeath (8256) is contracted in the ungated main guide — this guide only hunts the ghost, the main guide owns the quest. Respawn timer unconfirmed.

step Magister Hawkhelm — the center

  zone map 1447

  goto 58.46,30.89
  kill 6647 optional
  note Level 52 rare, flagged rare in the data, single confirmed point center.
  note The data records no exclusive drop on this rare (its Invisibility Potion drop is a 560-dropper world drop) — ordinary loot only. Respawn timer unconfirmed.

step Antilos — the west

  zone map 1447

  goto 16.6,54.1
  kill 6648 optional
  note Level 50 rare, flagged rare in the data, single confirmed point west.
  note The data records no exclusive drop on this rare — ordinary loot only. Respawn timer unconfirmed.

step Lady Sesspira — the center

  zone map 1447

  goto 35.39,55.69
  kill 6649 optional
  note Level 51 rare, flagged rare in the data, single confirmed point center.
  note The data records no exclusive drop on this rare — ordinary loot only (the same-name regular 239942 is a quest-target lookalike, not the rare). Respawn timer unconfirmed.

step General Fangferror — the center

  zone map 1447

  goto 41.31,53.96
  kill 6650 optional
  collect 17054 "Joonho's Mercy" optional
  note Level 51 rare, flagged rare in the data, single confirmed point center.
  note Joonho's Mercy drops only from Fangferror anywhere in the data; it starts nothing and is no quest's objective. Anything else is ordinary loot. Respawn timer unconfirmed.

